 "datePublished": "2022-06-27",
 "description": "<p>Group-IB Threat Intelligence and Attribution system has detected a malicious document at VirusTotal (VT). The file \"Пояснительная записка к ЗНИ.doc\" was submitted in 2022-06-23 21:18:58 UTC from RU via Web.</p><h2>RoyalRoad RTF</h2><p>The analyzed file \"Пояснительная записка к ЗНИ.doc\" is a malicious RTF document which was weaponized by Royal Road RTF Weaponizer. Royal Road is commonly used by Chinese-speaking attackers.</p><p>The decoy is about the request to change the passport of the federal project \"Information Security\" (№D4-2022/015 from 06.06.2022).</p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:504px;\"><img src=\"/api/v2/hi/threat/d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9/file/e6f748164140b4f42b89370449f7c46de181d77c163dcdbd1a10638359dc0fb0?placeholder=__IMAGE_d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9:e6f748164140b4f42b89370449f7c46de181d77c163dcdbd1a10638359dc0fb0_IMAGE__\"  /></figure><p>Meta-information of decoy:</p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:466px;\"><img src=\"/api/v2/hi/threat/d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9/file/23aaeb6be8c40812d87a3eec8cf1f40f652376bea40a380ea6f5e4899fa2d783?placeholder=__IMAGE_d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9:23aaeb6be8c40812d87a3eec8cf1f40f652376bea40a380ea6f5e4899fa2d783_IMAGE__\"  /></figure><p>The malicious encoded payload:</p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:589px;\"><img src=\"/api/v2/hi/threat/d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9/file/b7c8b37de4dd38c65e16ab18669df0dc272bfab46f8aac856f1667442b0c9ac1?placeholder=__IMAGE_d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9:b7c8b37de4dd38c65e16ab18669df0dc272bfab46f8aac856f1667442b0c9ac1_IMAGE__\"  /></figure><h2>Decoded payload - Bisonal.DoubleT variant</h2><p>The decoded payload is a malicious PE32 format EXE file which can be classified as a Bisonal.DoubleT backdoor. This malware provides remote access to a compromised computer and allows an attacker to execute various commands on it.</p><p>Compilation TimeDateStamp: 20.06.2022 03:16:24 UTC. The payload has the same capabilities as we described in previous <a href=\"https://tap.group-ib.com/ta/actors?ta=b9f1eb449d596cf1b57aa5ea974472b7fda3dd2e&amp;tab=timeline&amp;reportId=94257748c27154a5e1a02241fb93792b9f82a3e1\">notification</a>.</p><h2>Attribution</h2><p>This campaign belongs to APT Tonto Team. You can see it from Group-IB Graph picture:</p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:526px;\"><img src=\"/api/v2/hi/threat/d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9/file/582b34aacb02822591dbb04cfb5c54a90ebc7c8414e72d80bd26580977108968?placeholder=__IMAGE_d0fb1bbcb5d0bd411a88f3daee3aa396f6d4a3e9:582b34aacb02822591dbb04cfb5c54a90ebc7c8414e72d80bd26580977108968_IMAGE__\"  /></figure><h2>Additional IoCs</h2><h3><strong>URLs</strong></h3><ul><li>(Hello - GET request) hXXps://news[.]wooordhunts[.]com/ru/order/index.php?strPageID=[ID], where ID is a decimal number (example: hXXps://news[.]wooordhunts[.]com/ru/order/index.php?strPageID=167880896)</li><li>(Command - GET request) hXXps://news[.]wooordhunts[.]com/ru/news/index.php?strPageID=[ID]&amp;newsID=[YYYY-MM-DD-mmss]</li><li>(Response- POST request) hXXps://news[.]wooordhunts[.]com/xhome[.]native[.]page/datareader.php?sid=[ID]</li><li>(Download &amp; Execute - GET request) hXXps://news[.]wooordhunts[.]com/siteFiles/index.php?strPageID=[ID]</li></ul><h3><strong>Other IoCs</strong></h3><pre><code class=\"language-plaintext\">User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.1) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/66.0.3359.181 Safari/537.36\\r\\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\\r\\nAccept-Language: ru-RU,ru;q=0.9,en-US;q=0.8,en;q=0.7\\r\\nCookie: JSESSIONID=[Base32 encoded infromation about victim computer]</code></pre>",
